        "text": "Why bother? Because exam questions hand you this shape ready-made:\n\n(9 + 4)^2 + (9 − 4)^2\n\nJust compute 2(81 + 16) = 2 × 97 = 194.\n\nSpot the shape, skip the squaring.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
