      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now substitute xy = 126:\n\nx^2 + y^2 + 252 = 529\nx^2 + y^2 = 529 − 252 = 277\n\nYou never found x or y — and you never needed to.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
